Chapter: ProbeClosureSilent

 Candidate for the minimal silent case. Three ordinary definitions, one
 driver line. No let binding, no never-called function, no self call --
 even-fn and odd-fn simply call each other.

Section: Shapes

  add3 : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  add3 (x) (y) (z) = x + y + z

  even-fn : Integer -> (Integer, Integer -> Integer)
  even-fn (n) = if n == 0 then add3 5 else odd-fn (n - 1)

  odd-fn : Integer -> (Integer, Integer -> Integer)
  odd-fn (n) = even-fn n

Section: Driver

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("47 expected: " & show (((even-fn 4) 20) 22))
  end
